  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Analyse af Kinas udenrigspolitik i Syd&#xF8;stasien med s&#xE6;rligt henblik p&#xE5; Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching purpose with the project is to deliver in-dept analytical work, which can contribute to inform about the development in the danish foreign- and development politics in South East Asia by making comprehensive analysis&apos; of China&apos;s role and interests in the region. The analytical work will primarily be based on secondary litterature, interviews and the researchers own observations and experiences from Vietman, Myanmar. Laos and Thailand.</narrative>
